			{
				transport_prompt = "Create a detailed 5-day travel itinerary from " + current_location + " to " + destination + " for " + num_travelers + " travelers using public transport. Include:\n1. Day-by-day activities\n2. Transport details (trains/buses/flights)\n3. Estimated budget range in INR\n4. Top attractions for each day\nKeep response under 400 words.";
